### =============================================================================
### MINTA .http — masold at IC_00x_<szerviz>.http nevre es szabd a szervizedre.
###
### Elofeltetel:
###   1. VSCode extension: humao.rest-client
###   2. A repo gyokereben legyen kitoltott .env  (lasd .env.example)
###      A titkokat a {{$dotenv ...}} olvassa — SOHA ne ird be ide.
###
### Hasznalat: minden "###" blokk folott megjelenik a "Send Request" link.
### =============================================================================

@host     = {{$dotenv SAP_URL}}
@client   = {{$dotenv SAP_CLIENT}}
@user     = {{$dotenv SAP_USERNAME}}
@pass     = {{$dotenv SAP_PASSWORD}}

# A szerviz neve — ezt csereld a sajatodra (pl. ZEPT_PT_ACCOUNT_SRV).
@srv      = ZEPT_..._SRV
@baseUrl  = {{host}}sap/opu/odata/sap/{{srv}}


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1) Service document — el-e a szerviz, jo-e az auth?
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name serviceDoc
GET {{baseUrl}}/?sap-client={{client}}&$format=json
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{pass}}
Accept: application/json


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2) $metadata — entitasok, property-k, tipusok ellenorzese
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/$metadata?sap-client={{client}}
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{pass}}


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3) CSRF token lekerese (GET + X-CSRF-Token: Fetch)
###    A valasz headerebol a token es a cookie a kesobbi POST-hoz kell.
###    Hivatkozas: {{csrf.response.headers.x-csrf-token}}
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name csrf
GET {{baseUrl}}/?sap-client={{client}}
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{pass}}
X-CSRF-Token: Fetch


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4) EntitySet olvasas (GET) — lapozas, szures, rendezes
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/AccountSet?sap-client={{client}}&$top=5&$format=json
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{pass}}
Accept: application/json


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5) Egy entitas kulccsal (GET) — a kulcs formatuma a $metadata-bol
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/AccountSet('0000000001')?sap-client={{client}}&$format=json
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{pass}}
Accept: application/json


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6) Szures + navigacio (GET)
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/AccountSet?sap-client={{client}}&$filter=Bukrs eq '1000'&$orderby=Name asc&$top=10&$format=json
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{pass}}
Accept: application/json


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7) Letrehozas (POST) — CSRF token + cookie a 3) blokkbol
###    FONTOS: eloszor a "csrf" blokkot kuldd el, csak utana ezt.
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/AccountSet?sap-client={{client}}
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{pass}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf.response.headers.x-csrf-token}}
Cookie: {{csrf.response.headers.set-cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "Bukrs": "1000",
  "Name": "Teszt Ugyfel"
}


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8) Modositas (MERGE) — OData V2-ben MERGE a reszleges update
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
MERGE {{baseUrl}}/AccountSet('0000000001')?sap-client={{client}}
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{pass}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf.response.headers.x-csrf-token}}
Cookie: {{csrf.response.headers.set-cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Name": "Modositott nev"
}


### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9) Function import (GET vagy POST — a $metadata m:HttpMethod-ja donti el)
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/GetStatus?sap-client={{client}}&Partner='0000000001'&$format=json
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{pass}}
Accept: application/json
